# Ship only our own research that's in use, not third-party source or build output.
# Root .gitignore already covers *.pem, *.key, .env, __pycache__, .venv, *.wav.

# Third-party clones read during research (ethrex, mempool-workshop, sidecar, kohaku, ...), ~110 MB
tmp/

# forge / node / gradle build output and vendored libs (poc-evp-issuer/lib = forge-std, `forge install` restores it)
**/out/
**/out-osaka/
**/cache/
**/lib/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.gradle/
**/.kotlin/
**/build/

# Keeper and devnet runtime state, local keys (test or not, never commit them)
**/state/
**/keys/
**/footage/

# Local devnet: third-party clones and Rust build output (multi-GB)
devnet/.vendor/
devnet/.run/
devnet/ens-v2/
**/target/

# Research we decided not to use. Kept locally.
/0[0-9]-*
/2026-11-02-*.md
